        <div>
            <h3>About the Event</h3>
            <p>
                Our K12 Schools Jaipur students dressed up as little Krishnas and brought Janmashtami to life with joy and devotion! 🎉 With charming flutes and peacock feathers, the festivities were filled with color, culture, and creativity. Through these celebrations, our young ones also learned a valuable lesson from Lord Krishna: to always lead with love, kindness, and wisdom in every step of life. 🌟
            </p>
